# 统一行尾策略：文本文件一律 LF，二进制文件不做行尾转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# 已跟踪的二进制资源强制 binary（不触发 text 归一化）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.so binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.zip binary

# GitHub 语言统计忽略构建/发布脚本（tools/*.sh），语言条只反映 App 本体（Kotlin）
*.sh linguist-detectable=false